# AV1ATE Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values
# NEVER commit .env to Git!

# RevenueCat API Keys
# Get these from: https://app.revenuecat.com/ → Project → API Keys
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_IOS_API_KEY=your_ios_sdk_key_here
EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_API_KEY=your_android_sdk_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Create a RevenueCat account at https://www.revenuecat.com/
# 2. Create a new project and add iOS app
# 3. Copy the "Public iOS SDK key" from the API Keys section
# 4. Replace "your_ios_sdk_key_here" with your actual key
# 5. In Replit: Add these as Secrets (🔒 icon in sidebar)
# 6. For local dev: Copy this file to .env and add real keys

# See IAP_SETUP_GUIDE.md for detailed setup instructions
